      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-17T00:00:09Z",
      "text": "Al Jazeera also reports that Diallo claims to have support beyond Europe.",
      "cites": [
        "news:aljazeera:3ed0c66833db"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-17T00:00:18Z",
      "text": "On 12 November, Guatemala received the remains of the 1967 Nobel Prize in Literature recipient Miguel Ángel Asturias from France, 52 years after his death.",
      "cites": [
