      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-17T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "On 14 November, student protesters, unions, and the yellow vests held another nationwide protest in France, with over 100,000 participants.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-14:12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-17T00:00:42Z",
      "text": "France, officially the French Republic, is a country primarily located in Western Europe.",
      "cites": [
